OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after jewellery store
OL,4,Araid
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof robbery following a raid at a
OL,8,FPeterborough jewellery store that left
OL,9,Fa member of staff with life-threatening
OL,10,Finjuries.
OL,12,FSix men targeted Lala Jewellers on
OL,13,FGladstone Street shortly before midday
OL,14,Fon Saturday, according to
OL,15,FCambridgeshire Police. A 50-year-old
OL,16,Femployee was seriously injured during
OL,17,Fthe incident and remains in hospital.
OL,19,FPolice said a 43-year-old man and a
OL,20,F20-year-old man, both from Bradford,
OL,21,Fwere arrested on suspicion of robbery
OL,22,Fon Tuesday morning.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
